      "created_at": "2017-06-11T04:43:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We'd just watched Drop Dead Gorgeous, in which Adam West played the host on the Sarah Rose Pagaent video when we heard the news. We will now always remember Adam West in tandem with the line from Miss Minneapolis:&nbsp;<span> I've done about thirty-five pageants. I guess my most memorable one'd have to be Miss Teen America, 1995. It was in Vegas. My roommate did Adam West. She said he was soooo horny.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>I'd like auto think this will make him smile?</span></p>",
